{"applicability_conditions":"基于Williamson–Hall方程，利用(111)_γ、(200)和(220)衍射峰经高斯曲线拟合得到平均晶粒尺寸D和微应变⟨ε²⟩^{1/2}，用于测量不同拉伸应变下试样的位错密度。","identity":{"block_id":"b0024","equation_id":"equation_002","equation_number":"2","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\rho = \\frac {3 \\sqrt {2 \\pi} \\langle \\varepsilon^ {2} \\rangle^ {1 / 2}}{D b}\\tag{2}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.msea.2024.147741"},"latex":"\\rho = \\frac{3\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\langle\\varepsilon^{2}\\rangle^{1/2}}{Db}","purpose":"根据Williamson–Hall法估算的平均微应变⟨ε²⟩^{1/2}和平均晶粒尺寸D，计算（拉伸变形后试样中的）位错密度ρ。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"位错密度","symbol":"\\rho","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"平均微应变（average micro-strain）","symbol":"\\langle\\varepsilon^{2}\\rangle^{1/2}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"微应变（average micro-strain）","symbol":"\\varepsilon","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"平均晶粒尺寸（average crystallite size）","symbol":"D","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"Burgers矢量（Burgers vector）","symbol":"b","unit":"nm","value":"0.26 nm"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"位错密度计算式中的常数系数","symbol":"3\\sqrt{2\\pi}","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["该式引用自文献[36,37]。","计算D和⟨ε²⟩^{1/2}所用的(111)_γ、(200)、(220)衍射峰经高斯曲线拟合处理。"]}